---
source: crates/ym-cli/tests/cli.rs
expression: "help(&[\"info\"])"
---
Print metadata and the automatic estimates without rendering

Usage: ym info [OPTIONS] <FILES>...

Arguments:
  <FILES>...  ARW files to inspect

Options:
      --json                 Print one JSON object per file instead of text (the shape of `render --json` without `output` and `timings_ms`)
  -q, --quiet                Print only errors on stderr
      --profile <ID>         Force a camera profile, for comparisons (for example `sony-ilce-7rm4`)
  -v, --verbose              Print what is happening on stderr: stages, timings and notes
      --apple-auto <on|off>  Apple Auto for this run. On a Mac with Apple Intelligence, Apple's on-device model sets each photo's automatic exposure, contrast and saturation and makes its white warmer or cooler. Default: the app's setting where Apple Auto is available, off elsewhere
  -h, --help                 Print help
